Raster source: the ionicons font in Arc 1.170.0's ARCClients_Icons resource bundle (Contents/Resources/ionicons.ttf, SHA256 97087b7a242d8a246ee02c556da9ee0a904e04004b203ff91c4013294604709a, 1181 glyphs, 512 units per em). The font file is not distributed here.
Generation: each glyph at 16pt in a black attributed string, centred by its string size in a 16x16 unflipped template NSImage, drawn at (0,0,16,16) into a transparent 16x16 allocation at 1x and 2x. Its exact alpha is preserved while RGB is set to white for tinting. No crop-to-ink, stretch, fitted offset or contrast adjustment.

